  ArrowLeft, ArrowRight, BadgeCheck, BarChart3, BookOpen, Check, CheckCircle2, ChevronLeft, ChevronRight, ClipboardCheck, Gamepad2, Heart, Mic, RotateCcw, Square, Trophy, Timer, Zap,
